{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/extras/d4a700c2c002ad1bcaa2d9efb96b4ea7.poster.avif?t=1765472427\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/extras/d4a700c2c002ad1bcaa2d9efb96b4ea7.webm?t=1765472427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/extras/d4a700c2c002ad1bcaa2d9efb96b4ea7.mp4?t=1765472427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into the chair of a therapist and navigate the complex world of human emotions and weird personalities in Therapy Simulator!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This narrative-driven game puts you in the role of a therapist managing a diverse roster of patients. Each session brings a unique story, offering you choices to guide the conversation, uncover deeper truths, or hilariously steer the session off course. As you progress, you\u2019ll customize your cozy office, manage your schedule, and even influence the lives of your patients beyond the therapy room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/extras/f0f5c4439008c99a24fdb512bb465969.poster.avif?t=1765472427\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/extras/f0f5c4439008c99a24fdb512bb465969.webm?t=1765472427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/extras/f0f5c4439008c99a24fdb512bb465969.mp4?t=1765472427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Patient Stories</strong>: Experience hand-crafted personalities and dialogue, enhanced by AI, and carefully curated by real people.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching Choices</strong>: Your dialogue decisions shape each patient\u2019s journey\u2014and your own.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cozy, Immersive Environment</strong>: Set in a charming Manhattan office, complete with a dynamic window view of the bustling city below.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humor Meets Emotional Depth</strong>: Balance lighthearted absurdity with deeply human experiences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong>: Endless procedural patients keep the game fresh, even after completing the main story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to help patients, mess with their heads, or simply decorate your office to perfection, <i>Therapist Simulator</i> offers an engaging and unpredictable experience.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fresh Graduate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400530/9f85668a294c05ac9314b81ba3d6731636755a22.jpg"},{"name":"Therapy Intern","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400530/64084a517aac9e70e9c159dff7da723028e6d352.jpg"},{"name":"Therapy Professional","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400530/a674251ee5dcf09562044fdb9747d43023bb42ab.jpg"},{"name":"Johnny Sims","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400530/702efd1d1b291290074e12470d7c18c15fcc46c3.jpg"},{"name":"Nathan Jones","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400530/1a4c3585a80e0f436a9a5762ebffa07104dd01c4.jpg"},{"name":"Therapy Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400530/8e875ddd34aa2739e37b0b08d43cdae41fa856e5.jpg"},{"name":"Healing Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400530/d1ff065a2f2b111bf43b882c10eff0380d404407.jpg"},{"name":"Emotional Damage","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3400530/6a7fed5f9a62c31d272a82dd54847900c2fb447b.jpg"}],"total":8},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400530?t=1765472427","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3400530?t=1765472427","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/290f16a2b2fb1050bd24195738350cf56e386e3b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765472427","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/290f16a2b2fb1050bd24195738350cf56e386e3b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765472427","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/extras/d4a700c2c002ad1bcaa2d9efb96b4ea7.poster.avif?t=1765472427\" width=800 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/extras/d4a700c2c002ad1bcaa2d9efb96b4ea7.webm?t=1765472427\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/extras/d4a700c2c002ad1bcaa2d9efb96b4ea7.mp4?t=1765472427\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Step into the chair of a therapist and navigate the complex world of human emotions 