ity</strong>: Endless procedural patients keep the game fresh, even after completing the main story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you want to help patients, mess with their heads, or simply decorate your office to perfection, <i>Therapist Simulator</i> offers an engaging and unpredictable experience.</p>","developers":["Jemboy"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3400530/edd5aa89eed0361b81c744f8f49d91c184abe214/header.jpg?t=1765472427","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3400530/267456866/bc1d5817b1af3887c80b03ec6d227c874420019a/1763929423/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763929667","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3400530/267456866/bc1d5817b1af3887c80b03ec6d227c874420019a/1763929423/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763929667","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3400530/267456866/bc1d5817b1af3887c80b03ec6d227c874420019a/1763929423/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763929667","id":257136517,"name":"Demo Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136517/2b1d931262fb043e3d379d115c1cff2dce7a8b95/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763929667"}],"name":"Therapy Simulator","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_descript